  "gap": {
    "headline": "37% of recently disclosed flaws on CISA's exploited list were already being exploited when disclosed (2023–24: 37%, no clear change). For the rest, CISA confirmed exploitation after a median 17 days (2023–24: 21, no clear change). 157 such flaws were listed in 26 weeks, more than twice the 2023–24 pace (all CISA listings: 1.9 times).",
